{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_123_sit-title\">SiT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">SiT 将 DiT 放入 stochastic interpolant 框架，用统一模型显式比较 velocity、score 和 diffusion 参数化。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Places the Diffusion Transformer (DiT) backbone inside a continuous-time Stochastic Interpolant framework to systematically decouple interpolation schedules, model targets, and samplers.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">数据样本 x0、噪声 ε、连续时间 t 和可选类别条件</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Data sample x_0 (or latent), Gaussian noise ε, continuous time t ∈ [0,1], and conditioning label c</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">学习到的 velocity/score/noise 场及 ODE/SDE 生成样本</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Samples generated via configurable deterministic ODE or stochastic SDE integrators from the same SiT backbone</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Table 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">官方原始网络配置</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://scalable-interpolant.github.io/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_123_sit')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_123_sit')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"SiT original paper architecture figure, Table 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/f5641c51e1c6d45b0fc9.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Table 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_123_sit\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_123_sit')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_123_sit\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">数据与噪声端点</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">x0 来自数据，ε 来自简单高斯先验</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests data sample x_0 (or latent), gaussian noise ε, continuous time t ∈ [0,1], and conditioning label c and prepares initial tensor representations (noise).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"x0 来自数据，ε 来自简单高斯先验\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests data sample x_0 (or latent), gaussian noise ε, continuous time t ∈ [0,1], and conditioning label c and prepares initial tensor representations (noise).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"数据与噪声端点\" data-node-name-en=\"noise\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据与噪声端点</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">x0 来自数据，ε 来自简单高斯先验</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests data sample x_0 (or latent), gaussian noise ε, continuous time t ∈ [0,1], and conditioning label c and prepares initial tensor representations (noise).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 α(t)x0、σ(t)ε 与可选随机项定义连续概率路径\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stochastic interpolant xt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Stochastic interpolant xt\" data-node-name-en=\"Stochastic interpolant xt\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Stochastic interpolant xt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 α(t)x0、σ(t)ε 与可选随机项定义连续概率路径</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stochastic interpolant xt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把 xt 切成 token，并加入时间和类别条件\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Patch/time/condition embedding within the core scalable stochastic interpolant transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Patch/time/condition embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch/time/condition embedding\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patch/time/condition embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把 xt 切成 token，并加入时间和类别条件</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Patch/time/condition embedding within the core scalable stochastic interpolant transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"DiT 式 AdaLN 条件 Transformer 建模全局 token 交互\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Scalable Interpolant Transformer within the core scalable stochastic interpolant transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Scalable Interpolant Transformer\" data-node-name-en=\"Scalable Interpolant Transformer\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Scalable Interpolant Transformer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">DiT 式 AdaLN 条件 Transformer 建模全局 token 交互</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Scalable Interpolant Transformer within the core scalable stochastic interpolant transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"根据参数化选择输出 velocity、score 或 noise\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs v/score/noise prediction head within the core scalable stochastic interpolant transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"v/score/noise prediction head\" data-node-name-en=\"v/score/noise prediction head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>v/score/noise prediction head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">根据参数化选择输出 velocity、score 或 noise</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs v/score/noise prediction head within the core scalable stochastic interpolant transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"路径、预测参数化与时间权重可独立选择\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs interpolant loss within the core scalable stochastic interpolant transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"加权 interpolant loss\" data-node-name-en=\"interpolant loss\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">加权 interpolant loss</span><span class=\"lang-en\">interpolant loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">路径、预测参数化与时间权重可独立选择</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs interpolant loss within the core scalable stochastic interpolant transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从噪声端沿预测场积分到数据端\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Probability-flow ODE / SDE solver to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Probability-flow ODE / SDE solver\" data-node-name-en=\"Probability-flow ODE / SDE solver\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Probability-flow ODE / SDE solver</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从噪声端沿预测场积分到数据端</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Probability-flow ODE / SDE solver to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可配 classifier-free guidance\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces samples generated via configurable deterministic ode or stochastic sde integrators from the same sit backbone via Synthesized Sample.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"生成样本\" data-node-name-en=\"Synthesized Sample\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_123_sit', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Synthesized Sample</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可配 classifier-free guidance</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces samples generated via configurable deterministic ode or stochastic sde integrators from the same sit backbone via Synthesized Sample.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"SiT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 随机插值路径上的速度场匹配</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Stochastic Interpolant x_t = α_t x_0 + σ_t ε Unifying Velocity &amp; Score Parameterizations</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"SiT：核心公式 · 随机插值路径上的速度场匹配\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"123\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"12.038701pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -69.000129 266.069697 12.038701\" width=\"266.069697pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/s